nature doc parody. Explore more character reads and parody scripts.\",\"uploadDate\":\"2017-02-02T00:00:00+00:00\"}"}}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","h1",null,{"children":"Horizon Zero Dawn – Attenborough Style"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"page-header-sub","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<p>A parody-style David Attenborough voiceover for Horizon Zero Dawn, delivered with wit and precision by Guy Harris.</p>"}}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-post-body","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-main two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Another epic collaboration with IGN</h2>\r\n<p>Getting the email from <strong>IGN</strong> was a real treat. I'm often on their site scouting for new games, trailers and voiceover opportunities. As someone who grew up on the ZX Spectrum, C64 and PS3, lending my <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Voiceover\">Attenborough-style narration</a> to this trailer was pure joy.</p>\r\n<p>We nailed the tone quickly. They had a vision for a nature documentary-style parody, and we had a laugh crafting something unique. If you liked this, have a listen to my other Attenborough projects, such as <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/turkish-bird-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Turkish Airlines parody\">the Turkish Airlines spoof</a> or <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Cracking Ice Attenborough Voice\">Cracking Ice</a>, a frosty nod to Attenborough’s iconic delivery.</p>"}}],false,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"embed-wrap","children":["$","iframe",null,{"src":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/I_AbMKJbNEc","title":"Horizon Zero Dawn – Attenborough Style","allow":"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture","allowFullScreen":true}]}]}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/horizon-zero-dawn-voice.jpg","alt":"horizon-zero-dawn-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>What is Horizon Zero Dawn?</h2>\r\n<p><em>Horizon Zero Dawn</em> is an open-world RPG developed by Guerrilla Games. It follows Aloy, a skilled hunter living in a post-apocalyptic world ruled by machines. Her journey to uncover her origins and reclaim the Earth is packed with cinematic sequences, perfect for a nature-meets-gaming-style narration.</p>\r\n<p>And let’s face it... those giant robot giraffes are practically crying out for an <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"Generate your own Attenborough script\">Attenborough-style breakdown</a>.</p>"}}]]}],[["$","div","0",{"className":"blog-post-section two-col","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-text-col","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Want a voice like this?</h2>\r\n<p>If you’re looking for a realistic <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"David Attenborough Voiceover Artist\">David Attenborough voiceover</a>, I’ve got you covered. Whether it’s for a trailer, a documentary spoof, or a branded explainer, I bring the tone, pace, and polish you’d expect.</p>\r\n<p>Scripts must stay respectful, no profanity, no claiming to be him. But if you’ve got something fun and creative in mind, <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Contact VoiceoverGuy\">drop me a line</a> and let’s discuss it. Or try out the new <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/attenborough-script-generator\" title=\"Try the Script Generator\">Attenborough Script Generator</a> to bring your idea to life in a few clicks.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/attenborough-voice-og.jpg","alt":"horizon-zero-dawn-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"blog-post-section ","children":[null,["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-media-col","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/attenborough-voice-og.jpg","alt":"horizon-zero-dawn-voice","className":"blog-post-img"}]}]]}]],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-bottom-text","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"<h2>Searching for an explorer?</h2>\r\n<p>Need something with gravitas and a dash of humour? I can provide narration in the style of Sir David Attenborough, perfect for trailers, spoofs, explainer videos, and more. <a href=\"/https://www.voiceoverguy.co.uk/david-attenborough-voice\" title=\"Attenborough Soundalike Voiceover\">Have a listen to more examples</a> or <a href=\"/contact-guy\" title=\"Get in Touch\">get in touch</a> for a bespoke quote.</p>\r\n<p>This is not affiliated with Sir David himself. But it’s delivered with deep respect for his tone, pace and style. No profanity. No AI cloning. Just good, clean parody.</p>"}}],["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-post-cta","children":["$","$L3",null,{"href":"/voiceover-news","className":"cta-btn cta-btn--outline","children":"← Back to News & Blog"}]}],["$","$L4",null,{"pageTitle":"Horizon Zero Dawn – Attenborough Style","pageUrl":"horizon-zero-dawn-voice"}]]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"blog-related-strip","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"container","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-grid","children":[["$","$L3","807",{"href":"/guide-to-regional-english-accents","className":"blog-related-card","children":[["$","div",null,{"className":"blog-related-img-wrap","children":["$","img",null,{"src":"/assets/img/blog/english-accents1.jpg","alt":"A guide to regional English accents","className":"blog-related-img"}]}],["$","div",null,{